 behavioral_synastry: `When one person's Jupiter expands, the other person's Uranus supports that expansion with evolutionary innovation. When one person's Uranus disrupts, the other person's Jupiter shows the larger vision it serves. The trine means growth and revolution are allies. Use this for shared expansions that include necessary innovation.`,
