 core_transit: `Jupiter forms a trine to Uranus in the same elemental family. What wants to expand and what needs to disrupt are drawing from the same source during this 1-2 week period. Your growth principle and your revolutionary principle recognize each other as kin. When Jupiter expands, Uranus shows what pattern that breaks. When Uranus disrupts, Jupiter reveals the larger possibility. This is access to visionary innovation.`,
