 core: `Jupiter, expansion and optimism, meets Neptune, dissolution and transcendence, at the same degree. The planet that says yes and the planet that dissolves boundaries occupy the same space. This conjunction fuses growth with the ineffable. When Jupiter expands, Neptune is already showing what lies beyond rational possibility; when Neptune dissolves limits, Jupiter is already expanding into the vastness. This aspect produces mystical optimism: faith in what cannot be proven, vision that includes the transcendent. The gift is capacity for expansion beyond material limits. The shadow is confusion between genuine spiritual vision and escapist fantasy.`,
