 romantic_synastry: `One partner's Jupiter and the other's Neptune occupy the same space. Expansion and dissolution are unified. When you envision together, both growth and spiritual transcendence are present. The sustaining work is discernment between genuine vision and escapist fantasy.`,
 core_transit: `Jupiter meets Neptune at the same degree, fusing expansion and transcendence. What wants to grow and what dissolves boundaries occupy the same space during this 1-2 week period. Your growth principle and your mystical principle aren't separate. When Jupiter expands, Neptune shows what lies beyond rational limits. When Neptune encounters the ineffable, Jupiter expands into it with faith. This is access to mystical optimism.`,
